      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Overview",
      "anchor": "overview"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "Charleston in Distress equipment enchants apply to the Charleston Factory equipment."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "text": "The selectable enchant categories depend on the equipment type, and some equipment refined to +9 or higher can choose between the basic and the advanced category."
    },
