      "type": "heading",
      "text": "Notes",
      "anchor": "notice"
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Equip the Item First",
      "text": "Enchanting and resetting are done on equipment you are wearing. The target equipment must be equipped in the chosen slot."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "3rd Enchant Can Destroy",
      "text": "The 3rd enchant on normal equipment can destroy it, so proceed carefully."
    },
    {
      "type": "notice",
      "title": "Check Materials First",
      "text": "Both enchanting and resetting need 1 [ITEM:6752|Charleston Component] and 100,000 Zeny."
    },
